@reject_offer2
title: It seems we can't come to an agreement. 
new-page: true


@accept_offer2
title: Agree to the offer. 
unavailable-subtitle: The other parties will not accept the current offer. 
choose-if: influence > 43
new-page: true
on-arrival: lenin_anger += 1 if (commissariats_held < 10 or disarm_workers = 1 or bar_lenin = 1 or drop_chair = 1 or drop_foreign = 1 or drop_military = 1 or drop_internal = 1); moderate_dissent += 20 if lenin_anger = 2; moderate_strength -= 5 if lenin_anger = 2; moderate_dissent += 10 if lenin_anger >= 1; 

= Tentative Offer

[?if lenin_anger = 2: Despite the best efforts of the negotiators, Lenin still finds the proposed agreement an outrageous betrayal. While negotiations were underway, Lenin was campaigning for his position within the government, and has managed to galvanize the Petrograd Committee (and other influential bodies) against acceptance of any deal. With pressure now mounting, the Central Committee passes a resolution (by a one-vote margin) endorsing the current governmental configuration. Incensed by the counter-campaigning of the Bolshevik Moderates, Lenin also arranges for a condemnation letter against their actions. ?]

[?if lenin_anger = 1: Despite the best efforts of the negotiators, Lenin still finds the proposed agreement unacceptable. While negotiations were underway, Lenin was campaigning for his position within the government, and has managed to galvanize the Petrograd Committee (and other influential bodies) against acceptance of any deal. With pressure now mounting, the Central Committee passes a resolution (by a one-vote margin) endorsing the current governmental configuration. ?]

[?if lenin_anger = 0: Although Lenin is still highly critical of any sort of deal, the terms are just reasonable enough to where the Bolshevik Moderates are able to make a case for them to the rest of the Central Committee. If a vote was to be forced in the Central Committee at this moment, tentative approval for the agreement could be achieved. Although there is still a chance the deal will fall through when discussing the specifics with the other parties. ?]

- @accept_second
- @reject_second

@reject_second
title: We must reject the agreement still. 
new-page: true
on-arrival: sdi_relation -= 10; left_m_relation -= 10; centre_m_relation -= 10; right_m_relation -= 15; lsr_relation -= 10; centre_sr_relation -= 15; right_sr_relation -= 15; ns_relation -= 15; democraticity -= 2; instability += 6; vikzhel_unrest += 20; moderate_dissent += 10; leninist_dissent -= 5; leftcom_dissent -= 5; right_sr_strength += 8; right_m_strength += 8; 


Our sudden renegation on the agreement entirely shocks the other parties, seemingly proving the right socialists correct after all—more than likely compromise will be impossible from here on out. Likewise, we receive immense condemnation from various interest groups, and even some members of our own party.

Though on the other hand, Lenin's argument against cooperation carries some sway in the working-class districts of the capital, with workers' councils agreeing that they cannot compromise the values and gains of the October Revolution. 

Vikzhel immediately unleashes a full-scale strike across the railway network, and many other prominent unions and enterprises decide to join them. 





@accept_second
title: The Central Committee approves the agreement. 
unavailable-subtitle: There is not enough support for this. 
choose-if: lenin_anger = 0
new-page: true
on-arrival: commissariats_promised = commissariats_held; commissariats_held = 14; m_represented = 0; sr_represented = 0; lsr_represented = 0; ns_represented = 0; sdi_represented = 0;
go-to: cabinet_negotiations


@cabinet_negotiations
title: Cabinet negotiations
on-arrival: {!
  console.log("m_represented: ", Q.m_represented);
  console.log("sr_represented: ", Q.sr_represented);
  console.log("lsr_represented: ", Q.lsr_represented);
  console.log("commissariats_promised: ", Q.commissariats_promised);
  console.log("commissariats_held: ", Q.commissariats_held);
!}

- #commissariat_assign
- @finalize_deal
- @cancel_deal

@cancel_deal
title: On second thought, a deal is impossible. 
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
  Q.sdi_relation -= 10; Q.left_m_relation -= 10; Q.centre_m_relation -= 10; Q.right_m_relation -= 15; Q.lsr_relation -= 10; Q.centre_sr_relation -= 15; Q.right_sr_relation -= 15; Q.ns_relation -= 15;
  Q.right_sr_strength += 8; Q.right_m_strength += 8;   
  Q.democraticity -= 2; Q.instability += 6; Q.vikzhel_unrest += 20;
  Q.moderate_dissent += 10; Q.leninist_dissent -= 5; Q.leftcom_dissent -= 5;
  if (Q.education_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.education_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.education_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.transport_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.transport_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.transport_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.trade_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.trade_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.trade_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.finance_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.finance_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.finance_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.justice_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.justice_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.justice_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.labor_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.labor_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.labor_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.agriculture_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.agriculture_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.agriculture_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.food_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.food_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.food_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.posts_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.posts_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.posts_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.welfare_minister_party != "Bolshevik") {
    Q.welfare_minister = "Vacant";
    Q.welfare_minister_party = "Bolshevik";
  }
  if (Q.property_minister != "None") {
    Q.property_minister = "None";
    Q.property_minister_party = "";
  }
  if (Q.local_minister != "None") {
    Q.local_minister = "None";
    Q.local_minister_party = "";
  }
  if (Q.palaces_minister != "None") {
    Q.palaces_minister = "None";
    Q.palaces_minister_party = "";
  }
!}

Our sudden renegation on the agreement entirely shocks the other parties, seemingly proving the right socialists correct after all—more than likely compromise will be impossible from here on out. Likewise, we receive immense condemnation from various interest groups, and even some members of our own party.

Though on the other hand, Lenin's argument against cooperation carries some sway in the working-class districts of the capital, with workers' councils agreeing that they cannot compromise the values and gains of the October Revolution. 

Vikzhel immediately unleashes a full-scale strike across the railway network, and many other prominent unions and enterprises decide to join them. 

@finalize_deal
title: Finalize the agreement. 
choose-if: commissariats_held <= commissariats_promised and m_represented >= 1 and sr_represented >= 1 and lsr_represented >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: The other parties will not accept. [?if commissariats_held <= commissariats_promised : We have not granted enough appointments. ?] [?if sr_represented < 1 : The SRs expect a position. ?] [?if lsr_represented < 1 : The Left-SRs expect a position. ?] [?if m_represented < 1 : The Mensheviks expect a position. ?]
achievement: vikzhel_averted
on-arrival: {!
  Q.coalition_government = 1; 
  if (Q.m_represented >= 1) Q.m_in_gov = 1; 
  if (Q.sr_represented >= 1) Q.sr_in_gov = 1;
  if (Q.lsr_represented >= 1) Q.lsr_in_gov = 1;
  if (Q.ns_represented >= 1) Q.ns_in_gov = 1;
  if (Q.sdi_represented >= 1) Q.sdi_in_gov = 1;
  Q.sdi_relation += 10; Q.left_m_relation += 10; Q.centre_m_relation += 10; Q.right_m_relation += 10; Q.lsr_relation += 10; Q.centre_sr_relation += 10; Q.right_sr_relation += 10; Q.ns_relation += 10;
  Q.right_sr_strength -= 8; Q.right_m_strength -= 8;   
  Q.democraticity += 2; Q.instability -= 4; Q.vikzhel_unrest -= 20;
  Q.moderate_dissent -= 10; Q.leninist_dissent += 10; Q.leftcom_dissent += 5;
  Q.moderate_strength += 10; Q.leninist_strength -= 5; Q.leftcom_strength -= 5; 
!}

= Coalition Created

A coalition agreement has been reached! Vikzhel drops their threat of a strike, and pledges to cooperate with our government fully. The other parties leave the talks pleasantly surprised, if still slightly apprehensive about our motives. 

The Moderate Bolsheviks celebrate this as a major step forward. Lenin, however, is still far from convinced, predicting the coalition will end in disaster. 






